        "language": "english",
        "review": "A short but sweet puzzle game. I was recommended to try it by a friend of the developer, and enjoyed my time with it. There's a lot to take in, but with some persistence (and some liberal use of the in-game hint mechanism when getting stuck) I made it to the end.\n\nMy only complaint is that the difficulty curve was a bit uneven - I found the middle levels (5-7) to be the hardest, with level 7 being VERY hard to keep everything I was trying to accomplish in my head. Then level 8-9 were comparably much more straightforward.\n\nDefinitely worth the low, low price of two bucks. Kudos for making this!",
